/crates/codegen/                    @parveshgarg
/design/0008-precise-gc.md          @parveshgarg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Standard library: module surface (seam) and the module runtime fragments.
# Listed after runtime so these win for the stdlib-owned paths inside codegen.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
